            <title>[LU-20747] ZFS 2.4.4 build failing el9.7 build missing gcc-plugin-devel</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20747</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Trying to update ZFS in patch &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/68847" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/68847&lt;/a&gt; ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20276" title="sanityn test_70b test_71b test_71c: OOM crash for osd-zfs with ZFS 2.4.0" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20276"&gt;LU-20276&lt;/a&gt; zfs: update ZFS to 2.4.4") but it is failing due to missing &lt;tt&gt;gcc-plugin-devel&lt;/tt&gt; package.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/131641/arch=x86_64,build_type=server,distro=el9.7,ib_stack=inkernel/console" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/131641/arch=x86_64,build_type=server,distro=el9.7,ib_stack=inkernel/console&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;error: Failed build dependencies:
gcc-plugin-devel is needed by kernel-5.14.0-611.55.1.el9_7_lustre.x86_64
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
